<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Apply To Work With Me — Smash Your Wall</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --white: #fff;
      --gray: #e2e2e0;
      --text: #171717;
      --muted: #666;
      --accent: #a94f32;
      --border: #d2d2d0;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--white);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
    }

    .nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 18px 30px;
    }

    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #333;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .section {
      padding: 80px 30px;
    }

    .inner {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* HERO */

    .top-section {
      background: var(--gray);
      padding: 65px 30px 70px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 52px);
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin: 0 0 22px;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 21px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* INTRO */

    .intro-section {
      background: var(--white);
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 44px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin: 0 0 25px;
    }

    .intro-copy {
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    .intro-copy p {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .intro-copy p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* FORM */

    .form-section {
      background: #f7f7f5;
    }

    .form-intro {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .form-intro p {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .application-form {
      max-width: 750px;
    }

    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    .form-note {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .form-group input,
    .form-group textarea,
    .form-group select {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid #bdbdbd;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 14px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 16px;
      border-radius: 0;
    }

    .form-group textarea {
      min-height: 150px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .form-group select {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .submit-button {
      border: none;
      background: var(--text);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .submit-button:hover {
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    .bottom-note {
      margin-top: 25px;
      max-width: 650px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* BACK LINK */

    .back-link {
      margin-top: 35px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .back-link a {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .back-link a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* FOOTER */

    footer {
      background: #171717;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 35px 30px;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }

    .footer-copy {
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {

      .nav {
        padding: 15px 20px;
      }

      .nav-inner {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .nav-links {
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 60px 20px;
      }

      .top-section {
        padding: 50px 20px 55px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(36px, 10vw, 46px);
        letter-spacing: -1px;
      }

      .lead {
        font-size: 19px;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">

      <a href="index.html" class="brand">
        SMASH YOUR WALL
      </a>

      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="about-me.html">About Me</a>
        <a href="articles.html">Articles</a>
        <a href="memoir.html">My Memoir</a>
        <a href="work-with-me.html">Work With Me</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </nav>


  <!-- HERO -->

  <section class="top-section">
    <div class="inner">

      <div class="eyebrow">Coaching Application</div>

      <h1>
        Let's See If We're A Good Fit.
      </h1>

      <p class="lead">
        If you're serious about breaking through your approach anxiety,
        tell me a little about yourself and where you're stuck.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- INTRO -->

  <section class="section intro-section">
    <div class="inner">

      <div class="intro-copy">

        <h2>Before You Apply</h2>

        <p>
          This isn't a sales form. I want to understand where you're at,
          what you've tried, and what you're actually looking to change.
        </p>

        <p>
          There's no need to write the perfect answers. Just be honest.
          The more I understand about your situation, the better I can
          tell whether I think I can actually help you.
        </p>

        <p>
          If it looks like we might be a good fit, I'll get back to you
          and we'll figure out the next step from there.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- APPLICATION FORM -->

  <section class="section form-section">
    <div class="inner">

      <div class="form-intro">

        <h2>Your Application</h2>

        <p>
          Take your time. There are no right answers.
        </p>

      </div>


      <form
        class="application-form"
        action="https://formsubmit.co/smashyourwall@gmail.com"
        method="POST"
      >

        <input
          type="hidden"
          name="_next"
          value="https://smashyourwall.com/work-with-me.html"
        >

        <input
          type="hidden"
          name="_captcha"
          value="false"
        >


        <!-- NAME -->

        <div class="form-group">

          <label for="name">
            What should I call you?
          </label>

          <input
            type="text"
            id="name"
            name="Name"
            required
          >

        </div>


        <!-- EMAIL -->

        <div class="form-group">

          <label for="email">
            What's your email?
          </label>

          <input
            type="email"
            id="email"
            name="Email"
            required
          >

        </div>


        <!-- CURRENT SITUATION -->

        <div class="form-group">

          <label for="situation">
            Tell me about your current situation.
          </label>

          <textarea
            id="situation"
            name="Current Situation"
            placeholder="How long have you been struggling with this? What happens when you try to approach?"
            required
          ></textarea>

        </div>


        <!-- ATTEMPTS -->

        <div class="form-group">

          <label for="tried">
            What have you already tried?
          </label>

          <textarea
            id="tried"
            name="What They Have Tried"
            placeholder="Books, videos, courses, going out, practicing, coaching, etc."
          ></textarea>

        </div>


        <!-- GOAL -->

        <div class="form-group">

          <label for="goal">
            What would you most like to change?
          </label>

          <textarea
            id="goal"
            name="Desired Change"
            placeholder="What would be different in your life if you broke through this?"
            required
          ></textarea>

        </div>


        <!-- OFFER -->

        <div class="form-group">

          <label for="option">
            Which option are you most interested in?
          </label>

          <select
            id="option"
            name="Coaching Option"
            required
          >

            <option value="" selected disabled>
              Select one
            </option>

            <option value="1-on-1 6 Week Transformation">
              1-on-1 6 Week Transformation
            </option>

            <option value="1-Day Wall Smasher">
              1-Day Wall Smasher
            </option>

            <option value="3-Day Wall Smasher">
              3-Day Wall Smasher
            </option>

            <option value="Custom Wall Smasher">
              Custom Wall Smasher
            </option>

            <option value="Not Sure">
              I'm Not Sure Yet
            </option>

          </select>

        </div>


        <!-- FIT -->

        <div class="form-group">

          <label for="why">
            Why do you think now is the right time to work on this?
          </label>

          <textarea
            id="why"
            name="Why Now"
            required
          ></textarea>

        </div>


        <!-- ANYTHING ELSE -->

        <div class="form-group">

          <label for="anything">
            Anything else you want me to know?
          </label>

          <textarea
            id="anything"
            name="Anything Else"
          ></textarea>

        </div>


        <button
          type="submit"
          class="submit-button"
        >
          SUBMIT APPLICATION →
        </button>


        <p class="bottom-note">
          I'll read your application personally. If I think I can help,
          I'll get back to you by email and we'll go from there.
        </p>

      </form>


      <div class="back-link">
        <a href="work-with-me.html">
          ← Back to Work With Me
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- FOOTER -->

  <footer>

    <div class="footer-inner">

      <div class="footer-brand">
        SMASH YOUR WALL
      </div>

      <div class="footer-copy">
        © 2026 Smash Your Wall
      </div>

    </div>

  </footer>

</body>
</html>
